---
const sessionUrl =
  "https://hasgeek.com/jsfoo/2019-vueday/sub/building-form-field-components-in-an-enterprise-sc-MWpguweVW2MUkBXHCzQfei";
---

<article class="talk" aria-labelledby="talk-title">
  <div class="talk-details">
    <p class="byline mb-3">JSFoo VueDay, 2019</p>
    <h2 id="talk-title" class="text-xl leading-snug sm:text-2xl">
      Building form field components in an enterprise-scale product
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed sm:text-base">
      A look at how we built reusable forms at Chargebee with Vue: the patterns,
      challenges, and practical lessons behind flexible form field components at
      scale.
    </p>
    <ul class="byline mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2" aria-label="Topics">
      <li>Vue.js</li>
      <li>Component design</li>
      <li>Forms at scale</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="talk-video">
    <iframe
      src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/DJkp9qbVLmk"
      title="Building form field components in an enterprise-scale product, Bharathvaj Ganesan at JSFoo VueDay 2019"
      width="864"
      height="486"
      loading="lazy"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
      allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="talk-footer">
    <span class="byline">Recorded at JSFoo VueDay</span>
    <a href={sessionUrl} class="link text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
      Session details
    </a>
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .talk {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .talk-details {
    padding: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 36ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .talk-details > p {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .talk-video {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: var(--color-paper-2);
  }

  iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  .talk-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
  }
</style>
